          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Ankle procedures</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-8em\"><span class=\"standalone-link\"><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/foot-and-ankle/procedures/ankle-fracture.html\">Ankle Fracture</a></span></span></p>\n",
