  "pageshortdescription": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "shortDescTitle": "<p>Fit. Flexbility. Function.</p>\r\n",
    "shortDescTop": "<p>Our AxSOS 3 Periarticular Locking Plate System was designed to provide surgeons and patients with a well-fitting implant, especially important in distal tibia fractures where there may be little soft tissue coverage. An implant that fits may help cut down on OR-time by reducing the need to bend the plate, and may help reduce fracture malalignment and soft tissue prominence.</p>\r\n",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "douglas.depreker@stryker.com",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Feb 10 2020 18:21:16 GMT+0000",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/pageshortdescription",
    "textIsRich": [
      "true",
      "true",
      "true"
    ],
    "bulletList": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Streamlined instrumentation, such as one screwdriver for all screws and modular sets, is intended to allow the surgeon to do more, faster, potentially saving time and inventory space</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Our universal hole design allows for an individualized fixation approach</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Designed to ease extraction, our innovative locking screw head design allows for safe screw insertion, consistent locking, and screw removal</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      }
    }
  },
  "disclaimer": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "douglas.depreker@stryker.com",
    "disclaimer-type": "text",
    "disclaimer": "<p>A well-fitting implant may help avoid soft tissue prominence by limiting the gaps between the patient’s bone and the plate. When using a plate as a reduction tool, fracture malalignment is less likely to occur using a well-fitting implant.</p>\r\n<p>AXSOS-AWI-2, 09-2016</p>\r\n<p>Stryker Corporation or its divisions or other corporate affiliated entities own, use or have applied for the following trademarks or service marks: AxSOS 3, Stryker.  All other trademarks are trademarks of their respective owners or holders.</p>\r\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Feb 10 2020 20:50:55 GMT+0000",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/structure/disclaimer",
    "textIsRich": "true"
  }
